      en: "The Fernandes Bottling Company is a cornerstone of the Surinamese consumer goods industry. As an authorized bottler for Coca-Cola, the company brings world-famous brands into the country. At the same time, it produces its own iconic soft drink brand, 'Fernandes,' which enjoys legendary status not only in Suriname but also in the diaspora. Emerging from a small family business, Fernandes has developed into a modern, dynamic corporation that has significantly shaped the culture of taste. With its focus on quality and innovation, the company is an indispensable player that ensures the daily supply of refreshing beverages."
