      en: "The SAB rum distillery stands for the rich tradition of Surinamese sugarcane processing. As the maker of the famous Borgoe Rum, the company combines decades of experience with artisanal precision. The cultivation of high-quality sugarcane in the fertile areas of Suriname forms the basis for the unmistakable taste of the rum. Borgoe is today not only a quality product for connoisseurs but an integral part of the national culture. By combining tradition with modern distillation technology, the company has established itself as a renowned producer far beyond the country's borders, successfully carrying Suriname's culinary history out into the world."
